---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - My Tuition Center">
  <main id="page-privacy" class="page">
    <section style="background:var(--color-sig-cream);padding:var(--sp-section) 0 var(--sp-xxl);">
      <div class="container">
        <h1 class="display-lg" style="margin-bottom:var(--sp-sm);">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--color-muted);">Last updated: <strong>July 10, 2025</strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; Effective: <strong>July 10, 2025</strong></p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section style="background:var(--color-canvas);padding:var(--sp-section) 0;">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="legal-layout">
          <!-- TOC -->
          <nav class="legal-toc" aria-label="Table of contents">
            <p style="font-size: 14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;margin-bottom:var(--sp-sm);">Contents</p>
            <ul>
              <li><a href="#priv-1" class="legal-toc-link">1. Information We Collect</a></li>
              <li><a href="#priv-2" class="legal-toc-link">2. How We Use Your Information</a></li>
              <li><a href="#priv-3" class="legal-toc-link">3. Data Sharing</a></li>
              <li><a href="#priv-4" class="legal-toc-link">4. Cookies</a></li>
              <li><a href="#priv-5" class="legal-toc-link">5. Data Retention</a></li>
              <li><a href="#priv-6" class="legal-toc-link">6. Your Rights</a></li>
              <li><a href="#priv-7" class="legal-toc-link">7. Data Security</a></li>
              <li><a href="#priv-8" class="legal-toc-link">8. Children's Privacy</a></li>
              <li><a href="#priv-9" class="legal-toc-link">9. Contact Us</a></li>
            </ul>
          </nav>
          <!-- Prose -->
          <div class="legal-prose">
            <p class="legal-intro">My Tuition Center ("we", "us", "our") is committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains what data we collect, how we use it, and what rights you have regarding it.</p>

            <div class="legal-section" id="priv-1">
              <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
              <p>We collect information you provide directly to us when you:</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Create an account (name, email address, password)</li>
                <li>Book a trial or enroll in a course (phone number, subject preferences, payment details)</li>
                <li>Contact us via our contact form or email</li>
                <li>Subscribe to our newsletter</li>
              </ul>
              <p>We also automatically collect: IP address, browser type, pages visited, session duration, and device information when you use our platform.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-section" id="priv-2">
              <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
              <p>We use collected information to:</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Provide, maintain, and improve our tutoring services</li>
                <li>Process enrollments and payments</li>
                <li>Send administrative messages (booking confirmations, receipts)</li>
                <li>Send educational updates and promotional content (only with your consent)</li>
                <li>Personalise your learning experience</li>
                <li>Monitor platform security and prevent fraud</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-section" id="priv-3">
              <h2>3. Data Sharing</h2>
              <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell your personal information. We may share it with:</p>
              <ul>
                <li><strong>Service providers:</strong> Payment processors (Stripe), email services, hosting providers , bound by confidentiality agreements</li>
                <li><strong>Tutors:</strong> Your name and subject preference are shared with your assigned tutor to prepare your session</li>
                <li><strong>Legal authorities:</strong> When required by law or to protect the rights and safety of our community</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-section" id="priv-4">
              <h2>4. Cookies</h2>
              <p>We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to maintain session state, remember your preferences, and analyse platform usage. You can control cookies through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect platform functionality.</p>
              <p>Types of cookies we use: <strong>Essential</strong> (required for login), <strong>Analytics</strong> (Google Analytics , anonymised), <strong>Marketing</strong> (only if you opt in).</p>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-section" id="priv-5">
              <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
              <p>We retain your personal data for as long as your account is active or as needed to provide services. After account deletion, we retain anonymised usage statistics for up to 24 months. Financial records are retained for 7 years as required by Pakistani tax regulations.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-section" id="priv-6">
              <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
              <p>You have the right to:</p>
              <ul>
                <li><strong>Access</strong> the personal data we hold about you</li>
                <li><strong>Correct</strong> inaccurate or incomplete data</li>
                <li><strong>Delete</strong> your account and associated personal data</li>
                <li><strong>Opt out</strong> of marketing communications at any time</li>
                <li><strong>Data portability</strong> , request a copy in a machine-readable format</li>
              </ul>
              <p>To exercise these rights, email <a href="mailto:mutuitioncenter01@gmail.com" style="color:var(--color-link);">mutuitioncenter01@gmail.com</a>. We respond within 30 days.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-section" id="priv-7">
              <h2>7. Data Security</h2>
              <p>We implement industry-standard safeguards including: TLS encryption in transit, hashed passwords (bcrypt), access controls limiting staff access to your data, and regular security audits. No method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure; we encourage you to use a strong, unique password.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-section" id="priv-8">
              <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
              <p>Our platform is designed for students of all ages, including minors. For users under 13, parental or guardian consent is required before account creation. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children under 13 without verifiable parental consent. If you believe we have such data, contact us immediately.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-section" id="priv-9">
              <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
              <p>For privacy concerns, data requests, or to report a concern:</p>
              <div class="legal-contact-card">
                <strong>My Tuition Center , Privacy Team</strong><br>
                Sana Square, Nishtar Road, Garden West, Karachi 75540<br>
                📧 <a href="mailto:mutuitioncenter01@gmail.com" style="color:var(--color-link);">mutuitioncenter01@gmail.com</a><br>
                📞 +92 370 3438352
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Bottom CTA -->
            <div class="legal-bottom-cta">
              <p>Have a question about your data?</p>
              <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Contact Us</a>
              <a href="/terms" class="btn btn-secondary" style="margin-left:var(--sp-sm);">View Terms of Service</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
